Local Postshot private projection 0.1.0

ProjectionEWA3DGSFused.cu (renamed projection.cu), Common.h and Utils.cuh
derive from gsplat 1.5.3, Copyright the gsplat authors, Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat/tree/v1.5.3
Original notices and LICENSE are retained. GLM headers are used at build
time from the pinned checkout; its MIT/modified-MIT license is included.

Local modifications: separate module/namespace and checked one-camera
float32 pinhole API; determinant numerator/denominator/ratio floors at
binary32 1e-6; straight-through AA floor VJP with no extra denominator
epsilon; backward recomputes raw screen covariance from shared camera
state. The public projection Jacobian, covariance, general gradients,
radius/visibility and bbox policies remain public substitutes.

The small independent bindings, diagnostic API and Python wrapper are
part of Local Postshot. No original Postshot source, executable, library,
resource, PTX or other product artifact is loaded or distributed here.
